<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African Jan manufacturing output up 11.7 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>S.African Jan manufacturing output up 11.7 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African manufacturing production rose by 11.7 percent on a seasonally-adjusted basis in January compared with December, the Central Statistical Service (CSS) said.</p>
<p>Year-on-year, seasonally-adjusted manufacturing production was 6.3 percent higher.</p>
<p>Index of the physical volume of manufacturing production</p>
<p>(base 1990=100):</p>
<p>				 Jan '97	 Jan '96	Dec '96</p>
<p>    Seasonally adjusted  110.8	   104.2	   99.2</p>
<p>    Actual		    93.1	    87.4	   86.7</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
